From 46842afb44906ced02a9bd074c394f86fc57632d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Thu, 8 Oct 2026 21:05:25 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Account dropdown + login modal: 2px navy box edge -> 1px
 --hair, matching the dividers (popup precedent)

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01DgU7ophvEWkwzRHqdd2X8u
---
 docs/shipped.md | 4 ++++
 index.html      | 4 ++--
 2 files changed, 6 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/docs/shipped.md b/docs/shipped.md
index 11873c8..5316840 100644
--- a/docs/shipped.md
+++ b/docs/shipped.md
@@ -1116,3 +1116,7 @@ and 3x, with crops, and `truths.md`).
 - **Fail-soft:** nothing reads the new columns yet, so loading is unaffected. `addLocation()` sends them; if PostgREST answers PGRST204/42703 naming one of them, it retries the insert once without them, logs a warning and stops sending them for the session (`shortAddressColumnsMissing`). Any other error still shows the usual write banner.
 - **Backfill:** `tools/short-address-backfill.html` (owner's browser; same-origin, so the app's sign-in carries over, else an email/password form). Loads rows with `address_details IS NULL`; per row: Nominatim `search` for the stored address, kept only within 250m of the pin, else `reverse` at the pin (zoom 18); one request per >= 1.1s, identified by the page's Referer (browsers cannot set User-Agent). Review list (full -> short, source, distance) with a checkbox per row; Write updates only checked rows and only `WHERE address_details IS NULL`. Lookups are cached in localStorage, so a closed or paused run resumes. Rows with no result are left NULL (retried next run). **Duplicated port:** the tool carries a verbatim copy of `SHORT_ADDR_*`, `shortAddrWords()` and `deriveShortAddress()`; change both.
 - **Checks run (Chromium):** Impeccable gate PASSED (3/3 static, 16/16 runtime). Add-flow script against the real `index.html` with the gesture-harness stub and mocked Nominatim: columns present -> autocomplete pick, typed address and approx pin all insert details + short ("Skólavörðustígur 15 · Miðborg", "Grandagarður · Vesturbær"); columns missing -> the first insert is refused, retried without them and saved, later inserts skip them, no page errors, list loads 21 rows both ways. Backfill tool with a fake client + Nominatim: review rows correct (search within 250m, far search -> reverse, no-result row unchecked), request gap >= 1.1s, only checked + still-missing rows written, reload re-uses the cache with 0 new requests; port identical to `index.html`. Gesture gate not run: no row/touch code touched.
+
+## Box edges match the divider (2026-10-08, tweak)
+
+Owner: "that stroke around the sign in box... i used to have it elsewhere and we changed it to match the divider color and thickness -- lets make sure all the 2px blue box strokes have been changed to that". The precedent is the popup edge (2026-10-03, `32dc39b`: `1px solid var(--ink)` -> `1px solid var(--hair)`, "the dividers' --hair"). Changed `2px solid var(--navy)` -> `1px solid var(--hair)` on the two remaining navy-framed boxes: `#accountDropdown` and `#authModalContent`. Left: `#controls` border-bottom and the desktop rail's `#locations` border-right (single-side panel edges, owner call), focus rings (`box-shadow`/`outline` 2px navy), `.row-stamp-ring` (stamp ink, not a box edge), the sort menu (1px navy + 2px navy offset shadow, a deliberate printed-label look), 1px navy edges on `#addressAutocomplete`/`.sort-cap`/`.plan-form input`. Checks: Impeccable gate PASSED (3/3 static, 16/16 runtime); before/after stills at 390px 1x/3x.
diff --git a/index.html b/index.html
index 8f0f2d2..cd01953 100644
--- a/index.html
+++ b/index.html
@@ -424,7 +424,7 @@
       top: calc(74px + var(--chrome-top-inset));
       right: 74px;
       background: var(--paper);
-      border: 2px solid var(--navy);
+      border: 1px solid var(--hair);   /* the dividers' hairline, like the popup edge */
       border-radius: 2px;
       padding: var(--s4);
       z-index: 2000;
@@ -2112,7 +2112,7 @@
 
     #authModalContent {
       background: var(--paper);
-      border: 2px solid var(--navy);
+      border: 1px solid var(--hair);   /* the dividers' hairline, like the popup edge */
       border-radius: 2px;
       max-width: 400px;
       width: 100%;
-- 
